###
# @name GetSingleComment
# Get single comment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Expected Response: 200 OK
# {
#   "success": true,
#   "data": {
#     "id": "c1c2c3c4-1111-2222-3333-444455556666",
